## LAN
:autofold healthy

:bind-key --desc "MTR trace" --hint "[t]race" t :mux mtr %r

:resolv 10.0.0.1       router
:resolv 10.0.0.2       switch-core
:resolv 10.0.0.3       switch-floor2
:resolv 10.0.0.4       nas-backup
:resolv 10.0.0.254     gw-isp

10.0.0.{1..4}
10.0.0.254

## Internet

:resolv 8.8.8.8         gw-canary
:resolv 8.8.4.4         gw-canary-2
:resolv 1.1.1.1         inet-cf
:resolv 9.9.9.9         inet-quad9
:resolv 149.112.112.112 inet-quad9-2

